  "step_2": "The individual reports considering both lotteries. Initially, they were inclined toward Lottery A because it offers a 'sicherer Gewinn' (certain win) of 3000 Euros. However, after recalculating the expected value of Lottery B (4000 × 0.8 = 3200), they decided to choose B. The justification centers on the expected monetary value calculation (3200 Euros being higher than 3000), not on the maximum outcome alone or the negligibility of probability differences. The individual explicitly references a statistical or expected value computation as the decisive factor in shifting their choice from A to B.",
